<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs steady - update - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs steady - update - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were</p>
<p>steady. Demand and supplies moderate. Top $59.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs.  57.50-58.50, few 59.00-59.50</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs.  56.00-57.00</p>
<p>Sows: Under 500 lbs. steady, over 500 lbs. weak to 1.00 lower.</p>
<p>Top 49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-400 lbs. 43.00-45.00</p>
<p>	  400-500 lbs. 44.00-46.00</p>
<p>	  500-600 lbs. 46.00-47.00, few 48.00</p>
<p>few over  600 lbs. 48.00-49.00, few 47.00</p>
</text>
